
@startuml seq_auth

title Hotel Reservation System - Staff Authentication

actor "Hotel Staff" as Staff
participant "React Frontend" as UI
participant "FastAPI Backend" as API
database "PostgreSQL Database" as DB

== Staff Login ==

Staff -> UI: Enter username and password
UI -> API: POST /api/auth/login
activate API

API -> DB: Find staff account by username
DB --> API: Staff details and password hash

alt Valid password and active account
    API -> API: Verify password hash
    API -> API: Generate secure session token
    API -> DB: Store hashed token and expiration
    DB --> API: Session saved
    API --> UI: 200 OK + HttpOnly session cookie
    UI --> Staff: Display staff interface
else Invalid credentials or inactive account
    API --> UI: 401 Unauthorized
    UI --> Staff: Display login error
end

deactivate API

== Access Protected Function ==

Staff -> UI: Request protected function
UI -> API: API request with session cookie
activate API

API -> DB: Validate session and load staff role
DB --> API: Session and staff information

alt Session invalid or expired
    API --> UI: 401 Unauthorized
else Session valid but role not permitted
    API --> UI: 403 Forbidden
else Session valid and role permitted
    API -> API: Execute authorized operation
    API --> UI: 200 OK + response data
end

deactivate API

== Staff Logout ==

Staff -> UI: Click Logout
UI -> API: POST /api/auth/logout
activate API

API -> DB: Revoke current session
DB --> API: Session revoked

API --> UI: 200 OK + clear session cookie
UI --> Staff: Return to login page

deactivate API

== Access After Logout ==

Staff -> UI: Request protected function
UI -> API: API request
activate API

API --> UI: 401 Unauthorized
UI --> Staff: Login required

deactivate API

@enduml
